</p><p><a href="payment-methods">— Flexible finance options available</a></p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block block-padding-no-topbottom-padding block-width-large block-align-vert-center block-align-left home-intro-banner" data-block="home-block-14"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-1"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><div class="float full"style="--display-width:136px;"><picture class="" style="--width:136pxpx;--height:2800px;"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/trusted_brands_winner_2017_2026--w_136px-h_2800-e_svg-cp_center-cs_6076.svg" width="136px" height="2800" alt="Trusted Brands Winner 2017-2026" class="uk-object-contain svg-img" uk-img></picture></div><a href="#tb-pre-footer" uk-scroll="offset:90" class="intro-banner-button">Book my free consultation</a><ul class="intro-banner-text"><li>40 Years</li><li>10× NZ’s Most Trusted Brand</li><li>50,000+ Kitchens</li><li>10-Year Guarantee</li></ul><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block block-padding-no-topbottom-padding block-width-default block-align-vert-center block-align-left" data-block="home-block-15"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-1"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><p>&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;</p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group custom-foreground custom-background home-intro-image-grid" data-block-group="home-block-18"><div class="page-block block-padding-default block-width-large block-align-vert-top block-align-left" data-block="home-block-18"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-1"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><div class="tiles text-over alignment-left vert-alignment-top cssgrid cssgrid-auto cssgrid-default" style="--cell-width:300px;" uk-height-match="target: .content;"><div class="tile"><a href="appliance-promotion" class="tile" target="_self" title="Get a high-spec appliance package" rel=""><span class="content"><span class="image"><picture class="" style="background-color: rgba(69,59,49,0.3);--width:750px;--height:937px;"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/homepage_image--w_750-h_937-e_png-c_1-cp_center-cs_2299.png"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/homepage_image--w_750-h_937-e_png-c_1-cp_center-cs_2299.png 750w, edit/cache/images/homepage_image--w_563-h_703-e_png-c_1-cp_center-cs_1849.png 563w, edit/cache/images/homepage_image--w_375-h_469-e_png-c_1-cp_center-cs_1399.png 375w, edit/cache/images/homepage_image--w_188-h_235-e_png-c_1-cp_center-cs_950.png 188w" width="750" height="937" title="Get a high-spec appliance package" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture></span><span class="text"><h5>Get a high-spec appliance package</h5></span></span></a></div><div class="tile"><a href="kitchen-design-gallery" class="tile" target="_self" title="explore project design gallery" rel=""><span class="content"><span class="image"><picture class="" style="background-color: rgba(87,60,27,0.3);--width:750px;--height:937px;"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/home_image_1--w_750-h_937-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2293.jpeg"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/home_image_1--w_750-h_937-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2293.jpeg 750w, edit/cache/images/home_image_1--w_563-h_703-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1844.jpeg 563w, edit/cache/images/home_image_1--w_375-h_469-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1394.jpeg 375w, edit/cache/images/home_image_1--w_188-h_235-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_945.jpeg 188w" width="750" height="937" title="explore project design gallery" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture></span><span class="text"><h5>explore project design gallery</h5></span></span></a></div><div class="tile"><a href="our-showrooms" class="tile" target="_self" title="find your nearest showroom" rel=""><span class="content"><span class="image"><picture class="" style="background-color: rgba(69,62,56,0.3);--width:750px;--height:937px;"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/home_image_2--w_750-h_937-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2293.jpeg"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/home_image_2--w_750-h_937-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2293.jpeg 750w, edit/cache/images/home_image_2--w_563-h_703-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1844.jpeg 563w, edit/cache/images/home_image_2--w_375-h_469-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1394.jpeg 375w, edit/cache/images/home_image_2--w_188-h_235-e_jpeg-c_1-cp_center-cs_945.jpeg 188w" width="750" height="937" title="find your nearest showroom" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture></span><span class="text"><h5>find your nearest showroom</h5></span></span></a></div></div><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group" data-block-group="home-block"><div class="page-block block-padding-default block-width-large block-align-vert-top block-align-left tb-content-1" data-block="home-block"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-2"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><h2>The most trusted <br>kitchen company in <br>New Zealand.</h2><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><p>At Kitchen Studio we're very proud of the fact that we've been voted the most trusted kitchen brand in New Zealand for the tenth year running, and there are good reasons why more Kiwis trust us to transform their kitchen than anyone else. </p><p>
Kitchen Studio has been in business for 40 years and in that time we have perfected the art of kitchen design and the installation process. We were the first company to offer in home consultations with one of our top kitchen designers. This is all part of our service and is an essential part of the process to transform your kitchen into something to be proud of. </p><p>
To book a home consultation either call us on <a href="tel:0800 177 177">0800 177 177</a> or click the button to book online.</p><p>
<a href="#tb-pre-footer" class="uk-button uk-button-primary" uk-scroll="offset:90">Book My Free Consultation</a></p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group" data-block-group="home-block-6"></div><div class="page-block-group" data-block-group="home-block-2"><div class="page-block block-padding-default block-width-large block-align-vert-center block-align-left" data-block="home-block-2"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-1"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><h2 class="h1">Why choose <br />
Kitchen Studio?</h2><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group tb-images-1" data-block-group="home-block-5"><div class="page-block block-padding-large block-width-large block-align-vert-center block-align-left" data-block="home-block-5"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-2"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><div class="tiles image-top alignment-left vert-alignment-top cssgrid cssgrid-auto cssgrid-default" style="--cell-width:300px;" uk-height-match="target: .content;"><div class="tile"><span class="content"><span class="image"><picture class="stretch" style="background-color: rgba(183,131,92,0.3);"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/ks_image01--w_750-h_499-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2585.jpg"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/ks_image01--w_750-h_499-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2585.jpg 750w, edit/cache/images/ks_image01--w_563-h_375-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2120.jpg 563w, edit/cache/images/ks_image01--w_375-h_250-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1650.jpg 375w, edit/cache/images/ks_image01--w_188-h_125-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1182.jpg 188w" width="750" height="499" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture></span></span></div></div><h3>Total Trust Double Guarantee</h3><p>For total peace of mind, we provide a Deposit Guarantee AND a 10 years Total Trust Guarantee, which safeguards your investment. And if you sell your home, the guarantee is transferable to the new owner. </p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><div class="tiles image-top alignment-left vert-alignment-top cssgrid cssgrid-auto cssgrid-default" style="--cell-width:300px;" uk-height-match="target: .content;"><div class="tile"><span class="content"><span class="image"><picture class="stretch" style="background-color: rgba(142,57,31,0.3);"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/ks_homepage_most_trusted_2026_2--w_750-h_750-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2270.jpg"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/ks_homepage_most_trusted_2026_2--w_750-h_750-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2270.jpg 750w, edit/cache/images/ks_homepage_most_trusted_2026_2--w_563-h_563-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1850.jpg 563w, edit/cache/images/ks_homepage_most_trusted_2026_2--w_375-h_375-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1428.jpg 375w, edit/cache/images/ks_homepage_most_trusted_2026_2--w_188-h_188-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1008.jpg 188w" width="750" height="750" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture></span></span></div></div><h3>The Most Trusted</h3><p class="max-width-500">We've been voted winner of the most trusted kitchen brand in New Zealand, for kitchen designers and manufacturers for the tenth year running proving we are doing something right!</p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group tb-images-2" data-block-group="home-block-12"><div class="page-block block-padding-no-top-padding block-width-large block-align-vert-center block-align-left" data-block="home-block-12"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-2"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><div class="tiles image-top alignment-left vert-alignment-top cssgrid cssgrid-auto cssgrid-default" style="--cell-width:300px;" uk-height-match="target: .content;"><div class="tile"><span class="content"><span class="image"><picture class="stretch" style="background-color: rgba(66,61,56,0.3);"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/image_2_3--w_750-h_750-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_4000.jpg"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/image_2_3--w_750-h_750-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_4000.jpg 750w, edit/cache/images/image_2_3--w_563-h_563-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_3344.jpg 563w, edit/cache/images/image_2_3--w_375-h_375-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2684.jpg 375w, edit/cache/images/image_2_3--w_188-h_188-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2029.jpg 188w" width="750" height="750" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture></span></span></div></div><h3>Installed By Experts</h3><p class="max-width-500">Our talented team and network of trusted tradies have many years of experience in the field and will do everything they can to make your install go as smoothly as possible.</p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><div class="tiles image-top alignment-left vert-alignment-top cssgrid cssgrid-auto cssgrid-default" style="--cell-width:300px;" uk-height-match="target: .content;"><div class="tile"><span class="content"><span class="image"><picture class="stretch" style="background-color: rgba(93,52,17,0.3);"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/image_1_2--w_750-h_499-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_3236.jpg"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/image_1_2--w_750-h_499-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_3236.jpg 750w, edit/cache/images/image_1_2--w_563-h_375-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2771.jpg 563w, edit/cache/images/image_1_2--w_375-h_250-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2301.jpg 375w, edit/cache/images/image_1_2--w_188-h_125-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1833.jpg 188w" width="750" height="499" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture></span></span></div></div><h3>Bespoke Kitchens</h3><p>We create bespoke kitchens, not mass produced or inferior quality flat-packs. Every design is unique, crafted to suit your needs.</p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group custom-foreground custom-background" data-block-group="home-block-16"><div class="page-block block-padding-semi-large block-width-default block-align-vert-center block-align-center" data-block="home-block-16"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-1"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><h1>Get a high-spec Award appliance package with a combined RRP over $5,000 for $2,599*</h1><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group custom-foreground custom-background" data-block-group="home-block-17"><div class="page-block block-padding-no-top-padding block-width-default block-align-vert-center block-align-center" data-block="home-block-17"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-1"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><h2>Limited-time offer – ends October 31st</h2><p>*Terms and conditions apply</p><p class="button"><a class="uk-button-secondary uk-button uk-button-primary" href="appliance-promotion" target="_self" rel="">learn more</a></p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group" data-block-group="home-block-1"><div class="page-block block-padding-default block-width-large block-align-vert-bottom block-align-left tb-steps-1" data-block="home-block-1"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-2"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><h2 class="h1">Testimonials</h2><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><p class="button"><a class="uk-visible@m uk-button-secondary uk-button uk-button-primary" href="testimonials" target="_self" rel="">Discover All</a></p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group home-testimonials" data-block-group="home-block-10"><div class="page-block block-padding-default block-width-large block-align-vert-center block-align-left" data-block="home-block-10"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-1"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><ul class="testimonials-list"><li><span class="h4">Pervinder | Hamilton</span>“Kitchen Studio are really good at what they do, they take your thoughts and views into consideration and make a design that will be best for you in that space.”</li><li><span class="h4">Tania & Pete | North Shore</span>“If you want a stress free kitchen experience go to Kitchen Studio, we actually found the process to be fun.”</li><li><span class="h4">Julianna | Christchurch</span>“When my fiancé and I come home from work, we pour a drink, chat about our day and cook a meal together, it’s a really nice space to be in.”</li></ul><p class="button"><a class="uk-hidden@m uk-button-secondary uk-button uk-button-primary" href="testimonials" target="_self" rel="">Discover All</a></p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group" data-block-group="home-block-3"><div class="page-block block-padding-default block-width-large block-align-vert-bottom block-align-left tb-steps-1" data-block="home-block-3"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-2"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><h2 class="h1">Our 5 step process.</h2><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><p class="button"><a class="uk-visible@m uk-button-secondary uk-button uk-button-primary" href="how-we-work" target="_self" rel="">Find out more</a></p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block block-padding-no-top-padding block-width-large block-align-vert-center block-align-left tb-steps-1 tb-images-1 custom-bottom-padding-override" data-block="home-block-4"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-2"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><div class="tiles image-top alignment-left vert-alignment-top cssgrid cssgrid-auto cssgrid-default" style="--cell-width:300px;" uk-height-match="target: .content;"><div class="tile"><span class="content"><span class="image"><picture class="stretch" style="background-color: rgba(140,107,1,0.3);"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/ks_image02--w_750-h_853-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2187.jpg"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/ks_image02--w_750-h_853-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_2187.jpg 750w, edit/cache/images/ks_image02--w_563-h_640-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1759.jpg 563w, edit/cache/images/ks_image02--w_375-h_427-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_1330.jpg 375w, edit/cache/images/ks_image02--w_188-h_214-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_901.jpg 188w" width="750" height="853" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture></span></span></div></div><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><ol class="cb-ol-1"><li><span class="h4">It All Starts With You</span>Showroom consult and visit to create the brief</li><li><span class="h4">Design Response</span>Creating your bespoke plan</li><li><span class="h4">Showroom Presentation</span>Refining the details</li><li><span class="h4">Preparing to Build</span>Final checks and custom build implemented</li><li><span class="h4">Installation - Coordinating Perfection</span>We seamlessly install your new dream kitchen</li></ol><p class="button"><a class="uk-hidden@m uk-button-secondary uk-button uk-button-primary" href="how-we-work" target="_self" rel="">Find out more</a></p><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group custom-foreground custom-background" data-block-group="home-block-8"><div id="tb-pre-footer" class="page-block block-padding-default block-width-large block-align-vert-top block-align-left" data-block="home-block-8"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-1"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><iframe src="https://www3.kitchenstudio.co.nz/l/1090342/2026-01-18/7l7ky7" width="100%" height="500" type="text/html" frameborder="0" allowTransparency="true" style="border: 0"></iframe><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-block-group custom-foreground custom-background" data-block-group="home-block-7"><div class="page-block block-padding-no-padding block-width-full block-align-vert-center block-align-left uk-position-relative uk-hidden" data-block="home-block-7"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-1"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><div class="uk-position-relative mb-rotator-1" tabindex="-1" uk-slideshow=""><ul class="uk-slideshow-items"><li style="background-color: rgba(90,54,29,0.3);"><picture class="stretch" style="background-color: rgba(90,54,29,0.3);"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/dc1be3afb2d366af56f387415c993fda57be053c--w_2440-h_1440-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_8514.jpg"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/dc1be3afb2d366af56f387415c993fda57be053c--w_2440-h_1440-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_8514.jpg 2440w, edit/cache/images/dc1be3afb2d366af56f387415c993fda57be053c--w_1830-h_1080-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_6814.jpg 1830w, edit/cache/images/dc1be3afb2d366af56f387415c993fda57be053c--w_1220-h_720-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_5117.jpg 1220w, edit/cache/images/dc1be3afb2d366af56f387415c993fda57be053c--w_610-h_360-e_jpg-c_1-cp_center-cs_3419.jpg 610w" width="2440" height="1440" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture><div class="slideshow-inner"><span class="inner-wrap inner-width-full inner-middle-center"><span class="slideshow-inner-width"><span style="display: block;" uk-slideshow-parallax="x: 100px,0,-100px;"><h2 class="slideshow-h2" uk-slideshow-parallax="x: 50px,0,-50px;">Dream, To Design, To Done</h2><p>With New Zealand’s Most Trusted Kitchen Brand.</p><br />
