-width-large block-align-vert-center block-align-left uk-hidden" data-block="home-block-9"><div class="page-block-wrap"><div class="page-block-columns columns-2"><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><div class="tiles cssgrid cssgrid-auto" style="--cell-width:300px;" uk-height-match="target: .content;"><div class="tile"><span class="content"><span class="image"><picture class="" style="background-color: rgba(239,144,32,0.3);--width:750px;--height:457px;"><img data-src="edit/cache/images/promo_page_image_2_aw--w_750-h_457-e_jpeg-cp_center-cs_3496.jpeg"data-srcset="edit/cache/images/promo_page_image_2_aw--w_750-h_457-e_jpeg-cp_center-cs_3496.jpeg 750w, edit/cache/images/promo_page_image_2_aw--w_563-h_343-e_jpeg-cp_center-cs_3020.jpeg 563w, edit/cache/images/promo_page_image_2_aw--w_375-h_229-e_jpeg-cp_center-cs_2542.jpeg 375w, edit/cache/images/promo_page_image_2_aw--w_188-h_115-e_jpeg-cp_center-cs_2065.jpeg 188w" width="750" height="457" class="uk-object-contain" uk-img></picture></span></span></div></div><div class="spacing-bottom"></div></div></div><div class="page-block-column"><div class="page-block-column-inner"><div class="spacing-top"></div><h2 class="h3">36 months interest free with Q card until July 31st*</h2><p>With our Q Card Interest-Free financing, you can enjoy your perfect kitchen now while spreading payments over <strong>36 months with zero interest.<a href="#terms" uk-scroll="offset: 100">*</a></strong></p><p>
From morning coffee to family dinners to weekend entertaining, that's three years of making memories in your dream kitchen before your final payment.</p><p>
